      skos:note "The sprint retro frames a completed delivery (async decision widget) as a record-breaking velocity outcome, with the Zephyr integration identified as the causal unlock. Pattern: integration unblocks delivery, delivery sets new performance benchmark." .

    # ── Claims ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
    narr:Claim_VelocityHighestThisQuarter a narr:Claim ;
